:"baa tó à kɛ̀ɛ̀ zĩ'ũ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ìli ↄ̃a sɛ̃anɛ́ à a igbào,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ìli bↄ gbɛ̃́ pↄ́ a yã́ kú kpɛ ↄsãsãa yã́io.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Gbɛ̃́ pↄ́ ì kɛ màa a kpagua bauo.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/bqc_sim/PSA/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/bqc_sim/PSA/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/bqc_sim/PSA/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}